[
	// Military unit types give their units a 50% production cost reduction in cities with a Fortress.
	// The cost of a unit is only read from the unit (and its unit type) itself, so this is the only way
	// to express "military units cost 50% less in this city" without duplicating every military unit.
	// The conditional makes it Warriors-only, since only they can build a Fortress.
	// The entries below mirror the base ruleset's own unit types, plus the reduction.
